---
description: How to use store-media-kit to make App Store and Google Play screenshots, banners and preview videos
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md at the repository root: ask about the app first, capture clean real screens, write short
keyword-driven captions per language, render with `python3 kit.py shots`, review with `kit.py sheet`,
and never upload or store credentials without the user's explicit approval.
